  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</a> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the Answer Key for the post of 2nd Grade Teacher (Senior Teacher)/ Trained Graduate Teacher (TGT). This recruitment has been issued for 6500 posts. Online applying process for Rajasthan RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Recruitment 205 were accepted from 19 August 2025 to 17 September 2025. The Examination was conducted on 12-18 July 2026. Candidates who had appeared in this Examination can download their Rajasthan RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Answer Key 2026. which has given below.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RPSC Advt No 07/2025-26</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>17 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>19 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>17 September 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>17 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>12-18 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>05 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>08 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>28 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General / Other State : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>600/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OBC / BC : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC / ST : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>400/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Charge : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>500/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 6500 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 46.8394%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0578%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Area</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1027%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 46.8394%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">2nd Grade Teacher (Senior Teacher)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0578%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">TSP</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1027%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">696</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 27.0578%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Non TSP</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1027%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">5804</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Recruitment 2025 : Non TSP and TSP Area Vacancy Details</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Subject Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Non TSP Post</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>TSP Post</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Hindi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1005</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">47</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">English</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1150</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">155</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mathematics</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1184</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">201</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Science</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1160</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">195</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Social Science</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">401</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">0</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sanskrit</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">842</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">98</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Punjabi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">11</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">0</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Urdu</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">48</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">0</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sindhi</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">02</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">0</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Gujrati</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">0</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Online Form 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9454%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Subject</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.0546%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9454%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Hindi, English, Mathematics, Sanskrit, Punjabi, Sindhi, Gujrati, Urdu</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.0546%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Graduate or equivalent examination recognized by UGC with concerned subject as Optional Subject, and Degree or Diploma in Education recognized by the National Council of Teacher Education/Government.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Working knowledge of Hindi written in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9454%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Science</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.0546%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Graduate or equivalent examination recognized by UGC with at least two of the following subjects as Optional Subjects:- Physics, Chemistry, Zoology, Botany, Micro-Biology, Bio-Technology and Bio-Chemistry and Degree or Diploma in Education recognized by the National Council of Teacher Education/Government.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Working knowledge of Hindi written in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.9454%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Social Science</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.0546%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Graduate or equivalent examination recognized by UGC with at least two of the following subjects as Optional Subjects:-History, Geography, Economics, Political Science, Sociology, Public Administration and Philosophy, and Degree or Diploma in education recognized by the National Council of Teacher Education/Government.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Working knowledge of Hindi written in Devnagari Script and knowledge of Rajasthani culture.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates must click on the <strong>Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the <strong>Answer Key.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the <strong>Answer Key </strong>from the&nbsp;<strong>official website of RPSC</strong> also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"ce